How many continuous paths are there from $A$ to $B$, along segments of the figure, which do not revisit any of the seven labeled points?

[asy]
draw((0,0)--(3,0)--(3,2)--(0,2)--(0,0)--cycle,linewidth(2));
draw((0,2)--(1,0)--(3,2)--(0,2)--cycle,linewidth(2));
draw((0,2)--(1.5,3.5)--(3,2),linewidth(2));
pair G = intersectionpoint((0,2)--(1,0),(1.5,3.5)--(0,0));
dot("$G$", G, NE);

label("$A$",(1.5,3.5),N);
label("$B$",(0,0),SW);
label("$C$",(0,2),W);
label("$D$",(3,2),E);
label("$E$",(3,0),SE);
label("$F$",(1,0),S);
[/asy]
